,"children":[{"type":"text","value":"With "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"<name>"},{"type":"text","value":":"}]},{"type":"list","ordered":false,"items":[{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Markdown from "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"meta/<name>/SKILL.md"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"relative links within the package resolve from the caller's directory, using absolute paths when needed"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"reference files remain separate and are read only when their linked procedure is needed"}]}]}]}]}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"common-errors","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Common errors"}]},{"type":"list","ordered":false,"items":[{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Meta directory not found"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Invalid "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"<name>"},{"type":"text","value":" format"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Unknown "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"<name>"},{"type":"text","value":" (message suggests listing the available meta-skills)"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Read failure for target "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"SKILL.md"}]}]}]}],"headings":[{"id":"arguments","text":"Arguments","level":2},{"id":"output","text":"Output","level":2},{"id":"common-errors","text":"Common errors","level":2}]},"frameworks":[],"downloadMarkdown":"\n`intent meta` lists bundled meta-skills or prints one meta-skill file.\n\n<!-- ::start:tabs variant=\"package-manager\" mode=\"local-install\" -->\n\n```text\n@tanstack/intent@latest meta\n@tanstack/intent@latest meta <name>\n```\n\n<!-- ::end:tabs -->\n\n## Arguments\n\n- `<name>` is a meta-skill directory under `node_modules/@tanstack/intent/meta/`\n- Rejected values: any name containing `..`, `/`, or `\\\\`\n\n## Output\n\n- Without `<name>`:\n  - one line per meta-skill\n  - `name` + description from frontmatter\n  - description is normalized and truncated to 60 characters\n- With `<name>`:\n  - Markdown from `meta/<name>/SKILL.md`\n  - relative links within the package resolve from the caller's directory, using absolute paths when needed\n  - reference files remain separate and are read only when their linked procedure is needed\n\n## Common errors\n\n- Meta directory not found\n- Invalid `<name>` format\n- Unknown `<name>` (message suggests listing the available meta-skills)\n- Read failure for target `SKILL.md`\n","originalRawMarkdown":"---\ntitle: intent meta\nid: intent-meta\n---\n\n`intent meta` lists bundled meta-skills or prints one meta-skill file.\n\n<!-- ::start:tabs variant=\"package-manager\" mode=\"local-install\" -->\n\n```text\n@tanstack/intent@latest meta\n@tanstack/intent@latest meta <name>\n```\n\n<!-- ::end:tabs -->\n\n## Arguments\n\n- `<name>` is a meta-skill directory under `node_modules/@tanstack/intent/meta/`\n- Rejected values: any name containing `..`, `/`, or `\\\\`\n\n## Output\n\n- Without `<name>`:\n  - one line per meta-skill\n  - `name` + description from frontmatter\n  - description is normalized and truncated to 60 characters\n- With `<name>`:\n  - Markdown from `meta/<name>/SKILL.md`\n  - relative links within the package resolve from the caller's directory, using absolute paths when needed\n  - reference files remain separate and are read only when their linked procedure is needed\n\n## Common errors\n\n- Meta directory not found\n- Invalid `<name>` format\n- Unknown `<name>` (message suggests listing the available meta-skills)\n- Read failure for target `SKILL.md`\n"}
